# Shinobi attribution and third-party notices

## Project provenance

Shinobi is a modified derivative of **Skipii 0.5.20** by Decio Crytek, sourced from commit
`58d69b4f96563afc2d071c1ac31b3777831ca221` of <https://github.com/deciocrytek/Skipii>.
Skipii is licensed under GNU GPL version 3. Shinobi retains that license and preserves the
upstream attribution; this derivative has been rebranded, reorganized and extended with a
Shinobi theme, on-device signed-out history, caption selection/parsing, tests and project docs.
The upstream repository's GPL text is included as `LICENSE`.

